/**
 * Re-cut the corpus after repairing the pattern lexicon.
 *
 * The pattern indexer was trimming trailing particles unconditionally, which
 * mangled the patterns it was meant to index: とても became とて, もっと became
 * もっ, and をお願いします became をお願いし — a truncated verb stem with a
 * particle on the front, which then claimed 93 lines and put the kanji 願 inside
 * dictation answers that were supposed to be kana. The trim now applies only
 * when what remains is already a word.
 *
 * Every authored sentence is cut with those entries, so the tokens and the
 * questions cut from them have to be rebuilt.
 */
